WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:03.900
Here in Waimakariri, we're lucky to have
great beaches

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.480
and the beautiful Ashley Rakahuri Estuary.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.120
It's important that we look after these areas

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.000
and make sure everyone can enjoy them safely.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.420
So the Council got together with the community

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:17.380
and came up with the Northern Pegasus
Bay Bylaw.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:20.440
It has rules for cars, horses, dogs

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:23.520
and other beach activities
which you may not be aware of.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:30.000
Watch the video series and find out more at waimakariri.govt.nz/beaches

